{"page":414,"verses":[{"verse_key":"31:29","surah":31,"ayah":29,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَمْ تَرَ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يُولِجُ ٱلَّيْلَ فِى ٱلنَّهَارِ وَيُولِجُ ٱلنَّهَارَ فِى ٱلَّيْلِ وَسَخَّرَ ٱلشَّمْسَ وَٱلْقَمَرَ كُلٌّ يَجْرِىٓ إِلَىٰٓ أَجَلٍ مُّسَمًّى وَأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ خَبِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], do you not see that God causes the night to merge into day and the day to merge into night; that He has subjected the sun and the moon, each to run its course for a stated term; that He is aware of everything you [people] do?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"31:29"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَرَ","en_gloss":"you see","transliteration":"tara","verse_key":"31:29"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"31:29"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"31:29"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يُولِجُ","en_gloss":"causes to enter","transliteration":"yūliju","verse_key":"31:29"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلَ","en_gloss":"the night","transliteration":"al-layla","verse_key":"31:29"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"into","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"31:29"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلنَّهَارِ","en_gloss":"the day","transliteration":"l-nahāri","verse_key":"31:29"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَيُولِجُ","en_gloss":"and causes to enter","transliteration":"wayūliju","verse_key":"31:29"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلنَّهَارَ","en_gloss":"the day","transliteration":"l-nahāra","verse_key":"31:29"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"into","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"31:29"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلِ","en_gloss":"the night","transliteration":"al-layli","verse_key":"31:29"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَسَخَّرَ","en_gloss":"and has subjected","transliteration":"wasakhara","verse_key":"31:29"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلشَّمْسَ","en_gloss":"the sun","transliteration":"l-shamsa","verse_key":"31:29"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَٱلْقَمَرَ","en_gloss":"and the moon","transliteration":"wal-qamara","verse_key":"31:29"},{"