eration":"kafūrin","verse_key":"31:32"},{"pos":23,"ar":"٣٢","en_gloss":"(32)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"31:32"}]},{"verse_key":"31:33","surah":31,"ayah":33,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلنَّاسُ ٱتَّقُوا۟ رَبَّكُمْ وَٱخْشَوْا۟ يَوْمًا لَّا يَجْزِى وَالِدٌ عَن وَلَدِهِۦ وَلَا مَوْلُودٌ هُوَ جَازٍ عَن وَالِدِهِۦ شَيْـًٔا ۚ إِنَّ وَعْدَ ٱللَّهِ حَقٌّ ۖ فَلَا تَغُرَّنَّكُمُ ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ ٱلدُّنْيَا وَلَا يَغُرَّنَّكُم بِٱللَّهِ ٱلْغَرُورُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"People, be mindful of your Lord and fear a day when no parent will take the place of their child, nor a child take the place of their parent, in any way. God’s promise is true, so do not let the present life delude you, nor let the Deceiver delude you about God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"31:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسُ","en_gloss":"mankind","transliteration":"l-nāsu","verse_key":"31:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"Fear","transliteration":"ittaqū","verse_key":"31:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَبَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbakum","verse_key":"31:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱخْشَوْا۟","en_gloss":"and fear","transliteration":"wa-ikh'shaw","verse_key":"31:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَوْمًۭا","en_gloss":"a Day","transliteration":"yawman","verse_key":"31:33"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"31:33"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَجْزِى","en_gloss":"can avail","transliteration":"yajzī","verse_key":"31:33"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَالِدٌ","en_gloss":"a father","transliteration":"wālidun","verse_key":"31:33"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"[for]","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"31:33"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَدِهِۦ","en_gloss":"his son","transliteration":"waladihi","verse_key":"31:33"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"31:33"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَوْلُودٌ","en_gloss":"a son","transliteration":"mawlūdun","verse_key":"31:33"},{"pos":14,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"he","